<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh-TW">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>2026 澎湖精算行程 (5/23-26)</title>
    <style>
        :root {
            --primary: #0077b6;
            --accent: #e63946;
            --bg: #f0f4f8;
            --card-bg: #ffffff;
            --text: #2d3436;
            --travel-time: #636e72;
        }

        body { font-family: "Microsoft JhengHei", -apple-system, sans-serif; background: var(--bg); color: var(--text); margin: 0; padding: 0; line-height: 1.5; }
        .container { max-width: 900px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 10px; }
        
        /* Header */
        header { background: linear-gradient(120deg, #00b4d8, #0077b6); color: white; padding: 25px 15px; border-radius: 0 0 20px 20px; text-align: center; box-shadow: 0 4px 10px rgba(0,0,0,0.1); margin-bottom: 20px; }
        header h1 { margin: 0; font-size: 1.5rem; }
        header p { margin: 5px 0 0; opacity: 0.9; font-size: 0.9rem; }

        /* Alert Box */
        .alert { background: #fff3cd; border-left: 5px solid #ffc107; padding: 15px; border-radius: 8px; margin-bottom: 20px; font-size: 0.9rem; color: #856404; }
        .alert strong { display: block; margin-bottom: 5px; color: #d35400; }

        /* Toggle Buttons */
        .toggle-container { display: flex; justify-content: center; margin-bottom: 20px; background: #dfe6e9; padding: 5px; border-radius: 50px; width: fit-content; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; }
        .toggle-btn { padding: 8px 20px; border: none; background: transparent; cursor: pointer; font-weight: bold; color: #636e72; border-radius: 50px; transition: 0.3s; }
        .toggle-btn.active { background: white; color: var(--primary); box-shadow: 0 2px 5px rgba(0,0,0,0.1); }
        .toggle-btn.active[data-target="planB"] { color: var(--accent); }

        /* Day Card */
        .day-card { background: var(--card-bg); border-radius: 12px; overflow: hidden; margin-bottom: 25px; box-shadow: 0 4px 15px rgba(0,0,0,0.05); }
        .day-header { padding: 15px; background: var(--primary); color: white; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; }
        .day-title { font-weight: bold; font-size: 1.1rem; }
        .nav-link { background: rgba(255,255,255,0.2); color: white; text-decoration: none; padding: 5px 12px; border-radius: 15px; font-size: 0.8rem; }
        
        /* Specific Header Colors */
        .d1.planB .day-header { background: var(--accent); }
        .d2 .day-header { background: #e07a5f; }
        .d3 .day-header { background: #2a9d8f; }
        .d4 .day-header { background: #9b5de5; }

        /* Timeline Table */
        .timeline-table { width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; }
        .timeline-row { border-bottom: 1px solid #f1f1f1; }
        .timeline-row:last-child { border-bottom: none; }
        
        .col-time { width: 70px; padding: 15px 10px; text-align: center; vertical-align: top; border-right: 2px solid #f1f1f1; }
        .arrival-time { font-weight: 800; font-size: 1rem; color: var(--primary); display: block; }
        .duration-label { font-size: 0.75rem; color: #888; background: #eee; padding: 2px 5px; border-radius: 4px; margin-top: 5px; display: inline-block; }

        .col-content { padding: 15px 10px; vertical-align: top; }
        .spot-name { font-weight: bold; font-size: 1rem; display: block; margin-bottom: 5px; color: #2d3436; }
        .spot-detail { font-size: 0.9rem; color: #636e72; margin-bottom: 8px; }
        
        .col-travel { width: 60px; padding: 0; vertical-align: middle; text-align: center; font-size: 0.75rem; color: var(--travel-time); position: relative; }
        .travel-line { height: 100%; width: 2px; background: #e0e0e0; position: absolute; left: 50%; top: 0; z-index: 1; }
        .travel-badge { position: relative; z-index: 2; background: white; border: 1px solid #ddd; padding: 2px 5px; border-radius: 10px; font-size: 0.7rem; white-space: nowrap; }

        /* Tags */
        .tag { font-size: 0.75rem; padding: 2px 6px; border-radius: 4px; margin-right: 5px; color: white; }
        .tag-tide { background: #0984e3; } /* Tide dependent */
        .tag-eat { background: #f39c12; }
        .tag-stay { background: #6c5ce7; }
        
        /* Visibility */
        .plan-content { display: none; }
        .plan-content.visible { display: block; }
        .planB-text { color: var(--accent); }

        @media (max-width: 600px) {
            .col-time { width: 55px; padding: 10px 5px; }
            .arrival-time { font-size: 0.9rem; }
            .col-travel { width: 0; display: none; } /* Hide travel col on super small screens, simplified */
            .duration-label { display: block; }
        }
    </style>
    <script>
        function switchPlan(plan) {
            document.querySelectorAll('.toggle-btn').forEach(btn => btn.classList.remove('active'));
            document.querySelector(`.toggle-btn[data-target="${plan}"]`).classList.add('active');
            
            document.querySelectorAll('.plan-content').forEach(content => content.classList.remove('visible'));
            document.getElementById(plan).classList.add('visible');

            const card = document.getElementById('day1-card');
            card.className = `day-card d1 ${plan}`;
        }
    </script>
</head>
<body onload="switchPlan('planA')">

<header>
    <h1>2026 澎湖精算行程</h1>
    <p>5/23 (六) - 5/26 (二) | 采憶民宿 | 8人行</p>
</header>

<div class="container">

    <div class="alert">
        <strong>⚠️ 潮汐與行程關鍵報告：</strong>
        1. <strong>Day 1 (小潮)：</strong> 11:10 乾潮。天堂路與小摩西請準時前往。若要抱墩需趕在 11:00 前抵達。<br>
        2. <strong>Day 2 (藍洞)：</strong> 藍洞需配合船班，通常為上午巡航。<br>
        3. <strong>Day 3 (摩西分海)：</strong> 13:35 乾潮。最佳步道時間調整為 <strong>12:30</strong> (午餐後)，上午去海是合起來的。<br>
        4. <strong>返程：</strong> Day 4 飛機 14:00，<strong>12:40 務必離開市區</strong>。
    </div>

    <div class="toggle-container">
        <button class="toggle-btn active" data-target="planA" onclick="switchPlan('planA')">方案 A：北環觀光 (推薦)</button>
        <button class="toggle-btn" data-target="planB" onclick="switchPlan('planB')">方案 B：阿婆抱墩 (趕)</button>
    </div>

